  "prefLabel": "Bfc 206.02 Notice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfc 206.02 Notice. The board shall cause to be published in the New Hampshire Rulemaking Register a notice of its intent to hold a rulemaking hearing pursuant to RSA 541-A:6.\n\nSource. #10553-A, eff 3-25-14",
